hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"22289","Qutayba ibn Said narrated to us, Layth ibn Sad narrated to us, from Khalid ibn Yazid, from Said ibn Abi Hilal, from Yazid ibn Abd Allah, from Umayr, the freedman of Abi al-Lahm, from Abi al-Lahm, that he saw the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, at the stones of oil praying for rain, covering himself with his hands, supplicating."
